Fresh Pi session: DESIGN ONLY.

Inputs:
- Normalized work item artifact: {{run.dir}}/work-tracker/item.json
- Repository root: {{inputs.repo-root}}

Use only these provider-neutral fields from the normalized work item:
- identifier
- title
- description
- state.name
- priority
- assignees[].display_name or assignees[].id
- labels[].name or labels[].id
- url

Rules:
- Inspect the repository.
- Do not edit source code.
- Do not call Plane, Jira, GitHub, Slack, or other external APIs.
- Do not use tracker configuration, credential references, raw provider responses, or the provider-specific remote scope in the design.
- Write the design document and status, then stop.

Write:
- Design doc: {{run.dir}}/design/design.md
- Status JSON: {{run.dir}}/design/status.json

Status JSON:
{"status":"pass","summary":"short summary","issues_file":null}
